        "title": "Measurement Rigor and Chemical Safety Frameworks",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**This guide owns** two module-unique reference frameworks: (1) measurement science\n— SI/units discipline, uncertainty propagation (GUM), calibration performance, and\nGood Laboratory Practice; and (2) the *classification and documentation* systems of\nchemical safety — GHS/SDS, NFPA 704, hazard categories of reactive chemicals, PPE\nand engineering-control selection logic, and waste-stream segregation. It complements\nthe calibration content in `04` and the uncertainty needs of the whole module."
    },
